# Golden Project sha256 values in samples/*/golden_project.json are canonical LF.
# A Windows CRLF checkout rewrote project.rowlproj and broke
# rowl_demo_second_signal_packaged (CI runs 34694768878/34694916995/34695172306:
# "checksum mismatch for project.rowlproj"). Force LF so every platform hashes
# the same bytes. tests/test_demo_packaged.py additionally normalizes line
# endings before hashing, so pre-existing CRLF checkouts still verify.
*.rowlproj text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
